      <h1 id="attaching-pod" class="group scroll-mt-20">Attaching a pod to a secondary network<a href="#attaching-pod" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>To enable a pod to use additional network interfaces beyond the primary cluster network in OpenShift Container Platform, you can attach the pod to a secondary network. Secondary networks provide additional connectivity options for your workloads.</p>
      <h2 id="nw-multus-add-pod_attaching-pod" class="group scroll-mt-20">Adding a pod to a secondary network<a href="#nw-multus-add-pod_attaching-pod" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
