      <CodeBlock code={"metadata:\n  annotations:\n    k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: <network>[,<network>,...]"} lang="yaml" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the name of the secondary network to associate with the pod. To specify more than one secondary network, separate each network with a comma. Do not include whitespace between the comma. If you specify the same secondary network multiple times, that pod will have multiple network interfaces attached to that network.</p></dd>
      </dl>
