      <CodeBlock code={"metadata:\n  annotations:\n    k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: |-\n      [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"<network>\",\n          \"namespace\": \"<namespace>\",\n          \"default-route\": [\"<default_route>\"]\n        }\n      ]"} lang="yaml" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>&lt;network&gt;</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the name of the secondary network defined by a <code>NetworkAttachmentDefinition</code> object.</p></dd>
